  4.6500000000  0.0000000000  0.0000000000
  0.0000000000  4.6500000000  0.0000000000
  0.0000000000  0.0000000000  2.9800000000
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
  Ti  0.000000  0.000000  0.000000
  Ti  0.500000  0.500000  0.500000
  O   0.300000  0.300000  0.000000
  O   0.700000  0.700000  0.000000
  O   0.800000  0.200000  0.500000
  O   0.200000  0.800000  0.500000
K_POINTS automatic
